# The image's own entries for odd names in DNS (DNS_NAMES in /etc/amethystora/security.conf): the networks
# that name their servers with random-looking labels as a matter of course, CDNs and clouds above all. The
# machine's own are in /etc/amethystora/allow.d/dns-names (ame security allow dns-names NAME). A glob each.
*.cloudfront.net
*.akamaiedge.net
*.akamaized.net
*.amazonaws.com
*.azureedge.net
*.trafficmanager.net
*.googleusercontent.com
*.googlevideo.com
*.1e100.net
*.fastly.net
*.cdn77.org
*.edgekey.net
*.edgesuite.net
